.TH geectl-remote-project-diff 1  "geectl-remote-project-diff 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-project\-diff \- Diff two projects, package by package. Computed client\-side: the library lists both projects and reads every file of every differing package, so a large diff issues many requests and a differing binary file fails the call
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote project\-diff\fR [\fB\-\-include\fR] [\fB\-\-exclude\fR] [\fB\-\-annotate\-requests\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOLD\fR> <\fINEW\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diff two projects, package by package. Computed client\-side: the library lists both projects and reads every file of every differing package, so a large diff issues many requests and a differing binary file fails the call
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-include\fR \fI<INCLUDE>\fR
Only include packages with these exact names (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-exclude\fR \fI<EXCLUDE>\fR
Exclude packages with these exact names (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-annotate\-requests\fR
Annotate differing packages with their open submit requests
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOLD\fR>
The old project
.TP
<\fINEW\fR>
The new project
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
